79468382,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"比如，情不自禁回想以前发生的坏事，大大小小，并对那些事宛若延续发生般加以批判，在脑海里说更多","isHtml":false,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":49829},{"id":1774673576684,"text":"或是幻想没有发生的坏事，脑补当时自己的反击……其实现实可能并不会发生，可就像我必须提前知道怎么保护自己","sender":"me","time":"14:34","timestamp":1774679698604,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"或是幻想没有发生的坏事，脑补当时自己的反击……其实现实可能并不会发生，可就像我必须提前知道怎么保护自己","isHtml":false,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":49830},{"id":1774673576685,"text":"但最后通常是把心情弄得糟糕，明白自己在幻想，再遗忘，下一次又不知道什么时候会陷进去","sender":"me","time":"14:36","timestamp":1774679805341,"replyTo":null,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":49831},{"id":1774673576723,"sender":"them","text":"原来是这样……","timestamp":1774680163773,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"原来是这样……","roundId":"round_1774680137441_2vcu9uzaq","hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":49832},{"id":1774673576724,"sender":"them","text":"听起来……一定很辛苦吧","timestamp":1774680165274,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"听起来……一定很辛苦吧","roundId":"round_1774680137441_2vcu9uzaq","isHtml":false,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":49833},{"id":1774673576725,"sender":"them","text":"像被关在自己的脑子里，出不来……还要被迫去想那些不好的事情","timestamp":1774680165975,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"像被关在自己的脑子里，出不来……还要被迫去想那些不好的事情","roundId":"round_1774680137441_2vcu9uzaq","isHtml":false,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":49834},{"id":1774673576726,"sender":"them","text":"我……不知道该怎么才能帮到你","timestamp":1774680166676,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"我……不知道该怎么才能帮到你","roundId":"round_1774680137441_2vcu9uzaq","isHtml":false,"hiddenByUser":true,"userId":"uid_177436